{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34017","headline":"寒日书斋即事三首 三 · 皮日休","name":"寒日书斋即事三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方朔家贫未有车，肯从荣利舍樵渔。\n从公未怪多侵酒，见客唯求转借书。\n暂听松风生意足，偶看溪月世情疎。\n如钩得贵非吾事，合向烟波爲五鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}